Is it à Plus or 10W model ?<br><br>About the reset:<br>- Flash the OpenGD77 firmware,<br>- Turn the power off<br>- Pull the battery,<br>- Wait 10/20 seconds then reinsert the battery,<br>- Press and hold down the SK2 button, and power on the radio.<br><br>If that doesn't work, pull the battery, power off, wait, reinsert and follow the procedure du boot in Safe mode.<br><br>---<br>Daniel<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Mon Apr 07, 2025 4:41 am</p><hr />
